The institute aims to redefine AI education and foster future AI leaders by offering innovative online degree programs and specialized curriculum tracks for roles such as AI/ML Engineer, Data Scientist, and Generative AI Engineer. Anil Singh brings over 25 years of experience in organizational leadership and previously founded Hanu, a Microsoft Cloud Services company. Anaman Singh has over a decade and a half of experience and is fascinated by AI's ability to learn and solve problems.

