{"success": true, "operation": "search", "provider": "gemini", "output": [{"title": "AI Answer", "url": "", "snippet": "The "Shadhin AI" (স্বাধীন এআই) assistant, which is phonetically similar to "Swadhin," is a Bangla AI chat assistant application designed for Bangla-speaking individuals. It was built using Flutter and leverages Google's Gemini API to provide intelligent responses.

The project's GitHub repository indicates that it is a collaborative effort, and inquiries can be directed to eh.milon.dev@gmail.com, suggesting a developer or team is behind its creation. Additionally, Shadhin Lab LLC also offers "Shadhin Ai" as part of its AI solutions.

